{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Steady Heroes 是一款把日常流程變成孩子看得見、跟得到、按自己節奏完成的視覺化輔助工具，將每位孩子的固定事項拆成簡單步驟，完成後可賺取星星兌換獎勵，亦可記錄零用錢。原價 US $0.99，現正於 App Store 限時免費，特別適合養育神經多樣性兒童、容易焦慮的孩子，或任何在有結構安排下表現更好的家庭。</p>\n\n<h2>視覺化步驟與專注計時</h2>\n<p>每位英雄都有專屬的視覺化流程，逐步點按完成，並可選擇專注計時器協助掌握進度，計時結束不會有任何懲罰。情緒緊張時，內置冷靜休息提供零壓力暫停空間。完成步驟可換星星，兌換家長自訂的獎勵選單；開啟金錢模式後，程式會自動計算每個步驟對應的零用錢。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-427-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-428-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-429-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-430-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-431-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-432-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Steady Heroes</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-18T04:59:39.814779+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":339,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}